Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.39,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}EPISODE 2: THE DESTINED ONE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.39,0:01:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Miss Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:01:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So, hey, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.87,0:01:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. I mean you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.90,0:01:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the boy from your drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.71,0:01:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not only was it very rare for someone to\Napproach the witch without hostility,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.70,0:02:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but she was also consumed by regret and\Nguilt for what she'd done days before.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.77,0:02:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Henri.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.26,0:02:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, would your name happen to be Luna?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hitting on a black witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.87,0:02:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Henri's sure got some stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.01,0:02:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,A hero among womanizers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.29,0:02:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We've met somewhere before...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.35,0:02:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.78,0:02:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, dang.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.49,0:02:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the way he got\Nrejected is inconceivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.70,0:02:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Moo! Luna, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.97,0:02:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.23,0:02:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Bull, your friend came back for you.\NStraight out of a mushroom, of all things!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.49,0:03:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Moo! Luna, you dummy, dummy!\NYou abandoned me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.19,0:03:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.40,0:03:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- Moo!\N- Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.09,0:03:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Bull told me all about how shy you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.39,0:03:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Pet me more than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to surprise you. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.59,0:03:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A-And I'm sorry for running away like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.79,0:03:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um... and for the other stuff I did to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.79,0:03:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.79,0:03:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it! It really wasn't my imagination!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.57,0:03:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We really have met somewhere before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.61,0:03:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We danced in a moonlit sky, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.06,0:03:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You have memories from the drawing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.33,0:03:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't forget the way you looked that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:03:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, on that night, why...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.61,0:04:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.66,0:04:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't try to touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.49,0:04:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.34,0:04:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't your real body that night.\NThat's why I was able to touch you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.84,0:04:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But the truth is, my body is full of poisons\Nthat would be very dangerous to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.37,0:04:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for drawing a picture\Nof you without permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.49,0:04:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible! I've heard the rumors about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.04,0:04:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,About the Champignon Witch. Mushrooms really\Ndo sprout from everything you touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.43,0:04:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What a surprise! You and the mushrooms\Nare so much cuter than I imagined!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.18,0:04:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I could tell when we met before, but\Nyou aren't like the rumors say at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.76,0:05:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you only make poison mushrooms grow,\Nthough? Is it okay if I touch this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.44,0:05:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.94,0:05:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.20,0:05:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.54,0:05:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.70,0:05:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.11,0:05:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You just have a really interesting way\Nof showing embarrassment, Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.46,0:05:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, there's never a dull moment with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.45,0:05:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Henri... You're one to talk, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.58,0:05:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's turning into one of those studs\Nwho has tragically bad taste in women.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.34,0:05:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, because of your poison breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.42,0:05:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That amorous personality of his\Nwill get him into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.60,0:05:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but his puppy dog-like\Ncharm is what hooks people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But is this really okay? I hear his family's\Nall devoted white witch fundamentalists.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Loyal to the crown types.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.47,0:05:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.16,0:05:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, but Henri isn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.30,0:05:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but still, if one of his relatives\Nsaw this, there'd be hell to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.79,0:06:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he'd probably get chewed out for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.74,0:06:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Henri would, sure. But that black witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll end up on the witch\Nhunt list at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.74,0:06:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a fan of that kind of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.25,0:06:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.65,0:06:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell does she think she's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.47,0:06:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to keep apologizing for the drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.12,0:06:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really flattered that you liked\Nmy face that much, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.12,0:06:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I think when my soul passed\Nthrough the drawing to see you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,it wasn't only because of your powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.09,0:06:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm nowhere near the level of a witch or wizard,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,but I guess because of my background, I do\Nhave a kind of knack for things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.16,0:07:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The white witches in my family\Nare all really stuck up and mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I could always tell they looked down on me,\Nso I never thought too highly of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.44,0:07:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But you aren't like that at\Nall, Luna! It's so strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.99,0:07:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm with you,\Neven with all your poisons,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,my heart, even the air around me\Nfeels like it's been purified.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.29,0:07:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody else does that for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.12,0:07:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like you and your mushrooms wash\Naway everything rotten around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.68,0:07:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that part of your magic, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.56,0:07:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She's over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.53,0:07:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Luna?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.57,0:07:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Lu—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.86,0:07:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:08:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the black\Nwitch that was just here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.35,0:08:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.89,0:08:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- Impossible!\N- What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.96,0:08:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Lu—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.91,0:08:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Will I see you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.30,0:08:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I really want to! If you feel the same way,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.61,0:08:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,then draw another picture of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.79,0:08:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll come see you! I'll be waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.63,0:08:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Get the hell up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Claude?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.97,0:08:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all the commotion, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.51,0:08:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.43,0:08:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Making a move on someone under the white\Nwitches' protection, and in broad daylight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.44,0:08:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If the military police had captured you,\Nyou wouldn't have gotten off easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.71,0:09:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you completely forgotten who you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You failure of a witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.58,0:09:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't just barge into someone else's\Nhome and start ranting. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.29,0:09:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,At least explain what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.09,0:09:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So in other words, Miss Witch is\Nfinally opening her eyes to romance?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.93,0:09:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Romance, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.29,0:09:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh. That's great, Miss Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.21,0:09:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe those romance novels had an effect?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- Good for you!\N- Hmph! How lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.48,0:09:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get jealous, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.97,0:09:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody's jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.16,0:09:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This crow boy was someone who\Nalways watched over Luna.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.88,0:09:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was the familiar of a great\Nand respected wizard.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.97,0:09:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For some reason, he was always\Nvery controlling with Luna,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.90,0:09:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but he would also help her whenever needed.\NHe was a difficult, complicated person.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.82,0:09:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Look. You're not seeing that guy again. Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.34,0:09:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have a clue what you're planning,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.34,0:10:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but if you ever try to mess around with\Nhim again, I'll go straight to my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.31,0:10:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if something goes wrong, it's not\Ngonna end with just you getting purged.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.87,0:10:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna involve {\i1}all{\i0} of us\Nblack witches and wizards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.59,0:10:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.17,0:10:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.09,0:10:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- So this like this, and...\N- This is hard to draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.22,0:10:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Luna, did you see anything nice today?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.50,0:10:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Draw a picture of the prettiest\Nthing you saw in town today!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.50,0:10:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope it's food. Something\Nred and tasty looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.70,0:10:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to see you again.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.33,0:11:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I'm with you, my heart\Nfeels like it's been purified.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.56,0:11:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll be waiting.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.22,0:11:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Luna?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her hand started moving on its own,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.90,0:11:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and before she knew it, a drawing\Nspilled out onto the page.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.17,0:11:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the boy from before!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.79,0:11:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She'd merely wished to retrace the words\Nhe'd said, the way he'd looked...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.36,0:12:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Henri from the drawing couldn't speak.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.59,0:12:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you for drawing my picture again.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.92,0:12:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wanted to see you so badly, Luna.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.39,0:12:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But don't I look a little messier than before?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't intend to see you again.\NI thought that if I drew you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.66,0:12:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,it would cause trouble for the real you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.16,0:12:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I drew you poorly, maybe\Nyou wouldn't appear anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.95,0:12:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,At least, that's what I told myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it was an inanimate picture,\NI just had to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.96,0:12:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I know I shouldn't have. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.51,0:13:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But seeing you now still\Nmakes me so happy. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.97,0:13:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't cry, Luna.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.57,0:13:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your tears are beautiful,\Nbut I'd rather see you smiling.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.75,0:13:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I'm like this, I can't\Neven wipe away your tears.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.84,0:13:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's so frustrating.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.81,0:13:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Luna, when we danced in the moonlight,\Nyou had tears in your eyes then, too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.82,0:13:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And again when we were talking in town.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did I do something wrong?\NSomething that upset you?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.16,0:13:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.32,0:13:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Those were tears of joy. No one had ever\Ntouched me with such kindness before,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.78,0:13:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and it made me so happy. I felt such joy.\NI was overcome with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.02,0:14:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,but also sadness at the thought\Nof that moment ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.54,0:14:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd never known such joy before in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.66,0:14:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared even now. How could such\Nultimate joy also be so terrifying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.92,0:14:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If I want more, I fear it may come at\Nthe cost of someone else...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.67,0:14:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That it would destroy {\i1}your{\i0} joy in exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.14,0:14:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Luna, everything will be all right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.81,0:14:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know that you will continue to\Nfind joy in life. I promise it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.30,0:14:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want you to come with me, to find\Nwhat awaits beyond ultimate joy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.38,0:14:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To capture a joy that won't fade so easily.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So let's find a way to\Nspend more time together.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.57,0:14:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm willing to do absolutely\Nanything for you, Luna.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.69,0:14:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to be with you forever.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.32,0:15:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So keep drawing me, Luna. Now and forever.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll be fine! You don't need to worry\Nabout me. Do you understand, Luna?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.20,0:15:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because now, the only thing in this world\Nthat scares me is the thought of losing you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.83,0:16:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear about Henri?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.46,0:16:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been bedridden for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.74,0:16:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But the doctors can't find anything wrong.\NThey don't know why he's getting so gaunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't he start acting strangely\Nafter meeting that black witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.97,0:16:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Henri's family said they're going to\Nappeal to the white witches for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.30,0:16:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Tch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.26,0:16:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.72,0:16:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna draw Henri today? I made\Na promise to go shoot beans with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.42,0:17:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take a break\Nfrom drawing for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.66,0:17:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.45,0:17:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's seemed kind of exhausted recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.75,0:17:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,His lines have been looking really weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.34,0:17:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to see him, Luna?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.64,0:17:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But his lines looked so weak...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.96,0:17:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.32,0:17:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.10,0:17:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to stay away\Nfrom him, stupid witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.79,0:17:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Scary crow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.14,0:17:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm bigger than you, so watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.60,0:17:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Go see what you've\Ndone with your own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.23,0:18:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You get it now? Even with a "knack"\Nfor magic, he's still just a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.70,0:18:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't once think about\Nthe toll it takes on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.71,0:18:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Henri...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.26,0:18:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,When a witch with your kind of\Npower pulls a stunt like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.49,0:18:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,it's just like the humans and white witches\Nsay. It's all a black witch's seduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.50,0:18:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Henri...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.10,0:18:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to put an end to this, {\i1}now{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.05,0:18:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Luna's mushrooms, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.22,0:18:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You came all the way to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.55,0:18:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.08,0:19:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Along with the poison,\NLuna drew from Henri's heart{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.53,0:19:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}a mushroom that had grown out of\Nhis feelings for and memories of her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.82,0:19:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}More beautiful and delicate than\Nany mushroom she'd grown before,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.18,0:19:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it was almost like a flower.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.20,0:19:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The fact that his feelings for her\Nhad blossomed in his heart{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.69,0:20:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}into something so beautiful\Ngave the witch great joy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.84,0:20:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Luna, everything will be all right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want you to come with me, to find\Nwhat awaits beyond ultimate joy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.13,0:20:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Henri left her with an unfading joy\Nthat would last for the rest of her life,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.69,0:20:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}no matter what happened.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.73,0:20:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The witch etched that night onto her heart.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.25,0:20:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Henri...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.79,0:20:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.48,0:20:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Henri!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.66,0:20:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You look good as new! You sure\Nhad us worried for a while, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.90,0:20:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.06,0:20:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So what the heck was that\Nmystery disease, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.45,0:21:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,People were saying it was the black\Nwitch's curse. Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.40,0:21:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Black witch? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.78,0:21:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Man... you're turning into a real dirtbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.53,0:21:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.54,0:21:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.04,0:21:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And the days went by.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.75,0:21:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The march of the black witch\Nhunt grew louder and louder,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.55,0:21:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}while the witch herself made\Nfewer and fewer trips to town.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.26,0:21:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.45,0:21:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Merino, see Luna's feet? They\Neven grow mushrooms underwater!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.39,0:21:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's when it happened.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.94,0:22:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Luna, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.47,0:22:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.33,0:22:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was when the witch Luna and I first met.{\i0}
